{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q28131961","formula":"C₂₁H₃₂O₂","hill":"C21H32O2","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":21.0,"H":32.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Ethyltestosterone"},"descriptions":{"en":"Ethyltestosterone, or 17α-ethyltestosterone, also known as 17α-ethylandrost-4-en-17β-ol-3-one or 17α-pregn-4-en-17-ol-3-one, is a synthetic, orally active anabolic–androgenic steroid (AAS) of the 17α-alkylated group related to methyltestosterone which was never marketed. Like methyltestosterone, ethyltestosterone is the parent compound of many AAS. Derivatives of ethyltestosterone include norethandrolone (ethylnandrolone, ethylestrenolone), ethylestrenol (ethylnandrol), norboletone, ethyldienolone, tetrahydrogestrinone, bolenol (ethylnorandrostenol), and propetandrol. Ethyltestosterone is described as a very weak AAS and is considerably weaker as an AAS than is methyltestosterone.","uk":"Етилтестостерон (англ. Ethyltestosterone), або 17α-етилтестостерон, також відомий як 17α-етиландрост-4-ен-17β-ол-3-он або 17α-прегн-4-ен-17-ол-3-он — синтетичний, перорально активний андрогенний анаболічний стероїд 17α-алкільованої групи, спорідненої з метилтестостероном, який ніколи не продавався. Як і метилтестостерон, етилтестостерон є батьківською сполукою багатьох андрогенних анаболічних стероїдів."},"fame":2,"pubchemCid":13908542,"mass":316.5,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC[C@@]1(CC[C@@H]2[C@@]1(CC[C@H]3[C@H]2CCC4=CC(=O)CC[C@]34C)C)O","inchikey":"FGPGANCDNDLUST-CEGNMAFCSA-N","iupac":"(8R,9S,10R,13S,14S,17S)-17-ethyl-17-hydroxy-10,13-dimethyl-2,6,7,8,9,11,12,14,15,16-decahydro-1H-cyclopenta[a]phenanthren-3-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"13908542","atoms":55,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-4.764,"y":-0.915,"z":0.57,"el":"O"},{"x":5.917,"y":0.02,"z":-1.344,"el":"O"